pertise in the assigned teaching area. Requisite certification as deemed necessary by content area. Strong written, verbal, and interpersonal communication skills. Ability to effectively teach in a face-to-face learning environment. Commitment to student success and excellence in teaching. Preferred Qualifications Teaching experience in content area. Professional work or clinical experience in content area. Employment Conditions Position is part-time, non-tenure-track, adjunct. Application Instructions Positions are filled on an as needed basis for the 2026-2027 academic year. Open Date 10/22/2026 Application Review Date Close Date 05/10/2027 Posting Number 2027FC0033P Faculty Position Type Adjunct Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Curriculum Vitae Faculty-All transcripts Faculty - List of References Faculty - Letter of Interest Optional Documents IN THE HEART OF THE CAROLINAS © Winthrop University · 701 Oakland Avenue · Rock Hill, SC 29733, USA · 803/323-2211 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
